<p>Your Flame, Flameshock, Fireflash and Blastwave spells leave a burning wake on the ground, burning all within for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">32, 43, 51, 58, 65</acronym> fire damage for 4 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>